predator-protocol-site-v3/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/settings.json
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Parquet caches — never commit these (rebuilt every run)
data/markets_history/
data/vol_history/
data/markets/

# data/history_parquet/ is the PERMANENT year-partitioned archive (charter v2 Part 3)
# and is INTENTIONALLY NOT IGNORED — it must be committed to Git as the permanent
# zero-loss archive (Parquet_Store). Past-year partitions are immutable, current-year
# is mutable. The CHECKSUMS.json manifest at the store root is committed alongside
# the partitions. See scripts/migrate_to_parquet.py and tests/test_parquet_immutability.py.
#
# The authoritative source of the storage contract and the 5-year size analysis
# (~12.5 MB Parquet archive + ~7.8 MB Rolling_CSV + ~11 MB docs payload ≈ 32 MB total,
# well within GitHub's 1 GB limits) is .kiro/specs/bounded-data-zero-loss/design.md.

# Stray test output files
/test_audit_results.txt
/test_full_results.txt

# Git LFS note: Mega_Markets_Historical.xlsx is tracked via Git LFS.
