# Git LFS note: Mega_Markets_Historical.xlsx is tracked via Git LFS.
# The .gitattributes file at the repo root now declares `*.xlsx filter=lfs diff=lfs
# merge=lfs -text`, so future Excel blobs are routed through LFS automatically.
# Maintainer one-time history rewrite (already performed): see
# .kiro/specs/bounded-data-zero-loss/design.md → "Part C.1 — Git LFS migration procedure".
# Clones without `git lfs install` will get a pointer file; conviction/ingest_markets_xl.py
# detects this and raises a clear LFS-specific error.
